<title>SWEDEN: Sweden still has time to join EMU start - Riksbank.</title>
<headline>Sweden still has time to join EMU start - Riksbank.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The governor of Sweden's central bank, Urban Backstrom, said on Friday that Sweden still had time to join the European Union's Economic and Monetary Union (EMU) from the start in January 1999.</p>
</text>
